      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It brings me great joy that we managed to\r\nrecapture Fort Thines from the Demon Army's\r\nclutches -- but repairing the damage inflicted\r\nby those orcs is proving to be quite arduous.",
        "Jp" : "一度魔軍の手に落ちたティネス砦を\r\n奪還できたのは非常に喜ばしい――\r\nが、オークどもに荒らされた箇所の修繕は\r\nなかなか骨が折れますな"
      },
